+			In cases where an author wants to limit the number of actual lines in an element,
+			the <a class="css property" data-link-type="property" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-4/#propdef-max-lines" id="ref-for-propdef-max-lines">max-lines</a> property can be used instead.</p>
