+	all of the contributors to the <a href="http://www.w3.org/TR/css-values-3/#acknowledgments">previous level</a>
+	of this module.</p>
+   <p>Secondly, we would like to acknowledge
+	Anthony Frehner,
+	Emilio Cobos Álvarez,
+	Guillaume Lebas,
+	Koji Ishii,
